    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3105" root="بل" body-key="b">
    
      R. Q. 2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَبَلْبَلَ</span></b>  <i>He</i> (a man) <i>was moved by
grief</i> [or <i>anxiety:</i> see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَلْبَلَةٌ</span>, below]. (Har p. 94.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَبَلْبَلَتِ الأَلْسُنُ</span> <i>The tongues,</i> or <i>languages,
became mixed,</i> or <i>confounded.</i> (S, K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2- <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَبَلْبَلَتِ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الإِبِلُ الكَلَأَ</span> <i>The camels went on seeking the herbage,</i>
or <i>pasture, and left not of it aught.</i> (S, K.)

